---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
import legal from '../content/legal.json';
const toc = [
  { id: 'who-is-responsible', label: 'Who is responsible' },
  { id: 'what-we-collect', label: 'What we collect' },
  { id: 'why-we-use-it', label: 'Why we use it' },
  { id: 'who-else-handles-it', label: 'Who else handles it' },
  { id: 'sending-information-outside-south-africa', label: 'Sending information outside South Africa' },
  { id: 'how-long-we-keep-it', label: 'How long we keep it' },
  { id: 'how-we-protect-it', label: 'How we protect it' },
  { id: 'your-rights', label: 'Your rights' },
  { id: 'children', label: 'Children' },
  { id: 'changes', label: 'Changes' }
];
---
<LegalPage title="Privacy Policy — TiMO ODV" heading="Privacy Policy" toc={toc}>
<p>This policy explains what personal information this website collects, why, who sees it, and your rights under South Africa's Protection of Personal Information Act 4 of 2013 (POPIA). We keep it short because we collect very little.</p>

    <h2 id="who-is-responsible">Who is responsible</h2>
    <p>The responsible party is <strong>{legal.responsibleParty}</strong>, a South African company, registration number {legal.registrationNumber}. {legal.contactEmail ? <>You can contact us at <a href={`mailto:${legal.contactEmail}`}>{legal.contactEmail}</a>, or through the</> : <>You can contact us through the</>} <a href="/#contact">contact form</a> on this site. For privacy matters, please start your message with "Privacy request".</p>

    <h2 id="what-we-collect">What we collect</h2>
    <p><strong>1. Booking enquiries.</strong> If you use the contact form, we receive what you type: your name, email address, organisation, event date, venue and city, and your message. Only your name, email address and message are required.</p>
    <p><strong>2. Technical data.</strong> Like every website, our hosting provider receives your IP address, browser type and the pages you request when your device connects, so the site can be delivered and protected from attacks and abuse. We do not use this to identify you.</p>
    <p><strong>3. Nothing else.</strong> We have no user accounts or newsletter, and we do not use advertising, tracking or analytics tools. We do not build profiles of visitors.</p>

    <h2 id="why-we-use-it">Why we use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Your enquiry details are used only by us and TiMO ODV's management to read and reply to your enquiry and, if a booking follows, to arrange it. You give them to us by choosing to send the form.</li>
      <li>If you tick "Email me a copy", we send one email containing your enquiry to the address you gave, and nothing else.</li>
      <li>Technical data is used to deliver the site and keep it secure, which is a legitimate interest of ours and of visitors.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell your information, use it for marketing, or add you to any mailing list.</p>

    <h2 id="who-else-handles-it">Who else handles it</h2>
    <p>We use these service providers (operators) to run the site. They may only use your information to provide their service.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Cloudflare, Inc.</strong>: hosts the website, and runs Turnstile, the human-verification check on the contact form. Turnstile examines signals from your browser to tell people from automated bots. Cloudflare explains this in its Turnstile Privacy Addendum on cloudflare.com.</li>
      <li><strong>Afrihost</strong>, our South African email host: receives your enquiry from the website and stores it in the inbox that receives bookings.</li>
      <li><strong>TiMO ODV's management</strong>: a copy of each enquiry is sent to his management team so they can respond and arrange bookings. They may only use it for that purpose.</li>
      <li><strong>YouTube (Google)</strong>: only if you press play on the video on this page. See the <a href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Links to Spotify, Apple Music, YouTube Music, Instagram and other sites take you to services we do not control. Their own policies apply once you leave this site.</p>

    <h2 id="sending-information-outside-south-africa">Sending information outside South Africa</h2>
    <p>Cloudflare operates a global network, so it may process your technical data and the contact-form verification in countries outside South Africa, including the United States and the European Union. If you use the contact form, a copy of your enquiry also goes to TiMO ODV's management, who may be based outside South Africa. By using the contact form you agree to this. We choose providers that publish data-protection commitments, and we do not send your details anywhere else.</p>

    <h2 id="how-long-we-keep-it">How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>Enquiries that do not lead to a booking are deleted within {legal.enquiryRetention}. If a booking goes ahead, we keep the details for as long as the booking, and any records the law requires, need. Technical logs are kept by Cloudflare for short periods under its own policies.</p>

    <h2 id="how-we-protect-it">How we protect it</h2>
    <p>The site is served over HTTPS only, uses strict security headers, and loads no third-party scripts except Cloudflare's verification check, and only for the contact form. Form input is validated on our server and cannot be used to inject content into the site or emails. No system is perfectly secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security. If personal information is ever compromised, we will tell the Information Regulator and you, as POPIA requires.</p>

    <h2 id="your-rights">Your rights</h2>
    <p>You may ask us to tell you what personal information we hold about you, to correct it, or to delete it. You may object to our processing, or withdraw your consent, at any time. Withdrawing does not affect what we did before. Send your request through the contact form (or the email above), and we will reply within a reasonable time.</p>
    <p>If you believe we have not handled your information properly, please tell us first. You may also complain to the <strong>Information Regulator (South Africa)</strong>: <a href="https://inforegulator.org.za" rel="noopener noreferrer">inforegulator.org.za</a>, enquiries@inforegulator.org.za, tel. 010 023 5200.</p>

    <h2 id="children">Children</h2>
    <p>This site is not aimed at children under 18 and we do not knowingly collect their information. If you are under 18, please do not use the contact form without a parent or guardian.</p>

    <h2 id="changes">Changes</h2>
    <p>If we change what the site collects, we will update this page and its date.</p>
</LegalPage>
